  /* Schematic blocks:
     1. ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (U1) — main SoC
     2. SX1262 868 MHz radio (U2) — SPI bus
     3. MLX90640 thermal array (U3) — I2C bus 1
     4. MAX30102 PPG/SpO2 (U4) — I2C bus 1
     5. SCD41 CO2 (U5) — I2C bus 2
     6. SIM7600G 4G LTE (U6) — UART2
     7. UC8151d e-ink (U7) — SPI2
     8. BME280 (U8) — I2C bus 2
     9. LTC4040 UPS (U10) — power path
     10. BCG charge amplifier (3x LDT0-028K piezo → ADC1_CH3-5)
     11. Bed-shaker relay (REL1) — GPIO38
     12. Audio alarm relay (REL2) — GPIO39
     13. WS2812B 8x8 RGB matrix (LED1) — GPIO40
     14. MicroSD slot (J1) — SPI3
     15. Power input: USB-C 5V/3A + 12V SLA

     Pin assignments: see README.md pin assignment table.
     BOM: see hardware/bom/SeizureHub_BOM.csv
  */
